{"seq":3,"slug":"autogen-and-crewai","title":"AutoGen 与 CrewAI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/frameworks/autogen-and-crewai","wordCount":1386,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"autogen-与-crewai\">AutoGen 与 CrewAI</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AutoGen 与 CrewAI 面对的是同一个问题——<strong>如何让多个 Agent 协作</strong>——但它们给出了两种几乎相反的回答。理解这两个框架，最有效的方式不是记住各自 API，而是看清它们各自的「协作隐喻」。</p>\n<p><strong>AutoGen 的隐喻是「对话」。</strong> 它把多 Agent 协作建模成一场群聊：Agent 之间通过收发消息推进任务，谁在什么时候发言、发言是否触发他人，构成了运行逻辑。这个模型的优点是极度灵活——协作结构不是被写死的，而是在对话中自然涌现；缺点是流程不那么可预测，需要靠终止条件和发言规则来收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>CrewAI 的隐喻是「团队分工」。</strong> 它先定义好角色的职责（Role-Goal-Backstory），再把任务分配给角色，最后用流程（Process）把任务串起来。这个模型结构清晰、易于理解，特别适合职责边界分明的场景；代价是灵活性受流程约束，遇到角色划分之外的情况较难应对。</p>\n<p>两者的差异可以归结为一组对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>AutoGen（对话驱动）</th>\n<th>CrewAI（角色扮演）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协作建模</td>\n<td>消息传递的群聊</td>\n<td>角色 + 任务 + 流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>高，结构涌现</td>\n<td>中，结构预设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可预测性</td>\n<td>较低，依赖收敛规则</td>\n<td>较高，流程明确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>需灵活对话、代码执行</td>\n<td>结构化团队协作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型的核心判断是：<strong>你的任务更接近「一场需要反复商量的讨论」还是「一份分工明确的工作安排」</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph AutoGen&#10;        AG1[&quot;AssistantAgent&quot;] --&gt; AG2[&quot;GroupChat/GraphFlow&quot;]&#10;        AG2 --&gt; AG3[&quot;异步消息传递&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CrewAI&#10;        CR1[&quot;角色定义&quot;] --&gt; CR2[&quot;任务分配&quot;]&#10;        CR2 --&gt; CR3[&quot;流程编排&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph AutoGen\n        AG1[\"AssistantAgent\"] --&gt; AG2[\"GroupChat/GraphFlow\"]\n        AG2 --&gt; AG3[\"异步消息传递\"]\n    end\n    subgraph CrewAI\n        CR1[\"角色定义\"] --&gt; CR2[\"任务分配\"]\n        CR2 --&gt; CR3[\"流程编排\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"多-agent-框架概览\">多 Agent 框架概览</h2><p>AutoGen（微软）和 CrewAI 是两个代表性的多 Agent 框架。它们的核心目标相同——让多个 AI Agent 协作完成任务，但在设计哲学和使用方式上各有特色。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>版本提示：</strong> AutoGen 自 v0.4 起重构为事件驱动的异步架构，分为面向初学者的 AgentChat API 与面向高级场景的 Core API 两层；v0.2 API 已停止维护，PyPI 上的旧 <code>pyautogen</code> 包自 0.2.34 起不再由微软发布（见<a href=\"https://microsoft.github.io/autogen/stable//user-guide/agentchat-user-guide/migration-guide.html\">官方迁移指南</a>）。本节示例使用 v0.4+ 的新 API。此外，微软已在 AutoGen 与 Semantic Kernel 的基础上推出统一的 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/agent-framework/overview/agent-framework-overview\">Microsoft Agent Framework</a>，新项目选型时值得一并评估。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph AutoGen&#10;        direction TB&#10;        AG1[&quot;AssistantAgent&quot;] --&gt; AG2[&quot;团队协作&lt;br/&gt;GroupChat / GraphFlow&quot;]&#10;        AG2 --&gt; AG3[&quot;异步消息传递&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CrewAI&#10;        direction TB&#10;        CR1[&quot;角色定义&quot;] --&gt; CR2[&quot;任务分配&quot;]&#10;        CR2 --&gt; CR3[&quot;流程编排&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph AutoGen\n        direction TB\n        AG1[\"AssistantAgent\"] --&gt; AG2[\"团队协作&lt;br/&gt;GroupChat / GraphFlow\"]\n        AG2 --&gt; AG3[\"异步消息传递\"]\n    end\n    subgraph CrewAI\n        direction TB\n        CR1[\"角色定义\"] --&gt; CR2[\"任务分配\"]\n        CR2 --&gt; CR3[\"流程编排\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>开发者</th>\n<th>核心理念</th>\n<th>编排方式</th>\n<th>学习曲线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AutoGen</td>\n<td>微软</td>\n<td>对话驱动的多 Agent</td>\n<td>Agent 间消息传递</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CrewAI</td>\n<td>社区</td>\n<td>角色扮演的团队协作</td>\n<td>角色→任务→流程</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"autogen-对话驱动\">AutoGen：对话驱动</h2><p>AutoGen 的核心抽象是 Agent——每个 Agent 都是一个可以参与对话的实体。多 Agent 协作通过 Agent 之间的消息传递来实现；v0.4 起 Agent 是异步运行的，团队（Team）负责编排消息流转。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import asyncio&#10;&#10;from autogen_agentchat.agents import AssistantAgent&#10;from autogen_ext.models.openai import OpenAIChatCompletionClient&#10;&#10;model_client = OpenAIChatCompletionClient(model=&quot;gpt-5.6-terra&quot;)  # 型号以厂商当前文档为准&#10;&#10;assistant = AssistantAgent(&#10;    name=&quot;coding_assistant&quot;,&#10;    system_message=&quot;你是一个专业的 Python 程序员。编写高质量代码并解释你的实现。&quot;,&#10;    model_client=model_client,&#10;)&#10;&#10;async def main() -&gt; None:&#10;    result = await assistant.run(&#10;        task=&quot;实现一个 LRU 缓存，支持 get 和 put 操作，时间复杂度 O(1)。&quot;&#10;    )&#10;    print(result.messages[-1].content)&#10;&#10;asyncio.run(main())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autogen_agentchat.agents </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AssistantAgent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autogen_ext.models.openai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAIChatCompletionClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAIChatCompletionClient(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5.6-terra\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 型号以厂商当前文档为准</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">assistant </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AssistantAgent(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coding_assistant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    system_message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"你是一个专业的 Python 程序员。编写高质量代码并解释你的实现。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model_client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_client,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assistant.run(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"实现一个 LRU 缓存，支持 get 和 put 操作，时间复杂度 O(1)。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.messages[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">asyncio.run(main())</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AutoGen 支持多种对话模式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 双人对话&#10;        A1[&quot;Agent A&quot;] &lt;--&gt; A2[&quot;Agent B&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 团队轮转&#10;        M[&quot;RoundRobinGroupChat&lt;br/&gt;按序轮流发言&quot;] --&gt; G1[&quot;Agent 1&quot;]&#10;        M --&gt; G2[&quot;Agent 2&quot;]&#10;        M --&gt; G3[&quot;Agent 3&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 双人对话\n        A1[\"Agent A\"] &lt;--&gt; A2[\"Agent B\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 团队轮转\n        M[\"RoundRobinGroupChat&lt;br/&gt;按序轮流发言\"] --&gt; G1[\"Agent 1\"]\n        M --&gt; G2[\"Agent 2\"]\n        M --&gt; G3[\"Agent 3\"]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import asyncio&#10;&#10;from autogen_agentchat.agents import AssistantAgent&#10;from autogen_agentchat.teams import RoundRobinGroupChat&#10;from autogen_agentchat.conditions import MaxMessageTermination, TextMentionTermination&#10;from autogen_ext.models.openai import OpenAIChatCompletionClient&#10;&#10;model_client = OpenAIChatCompletionClient(model=&quot;gpt-5.6-terra&quot;)&#10;&#10;coder = AssistantAgent(&#10;    name=&quot;coder&quot;,&#10;    system_message=&quot;你是程序员，负责编写代码实现。&quot;,&#10;    model_client=model_client,&#10;)&#10;reviewer = AssistantAgent(&#10;    name=&quot;reviewer&quot;,&#10;    system_message=&quot;你是审查员。审查通过时在回复末尾写 APPROVE。&quot;,&#10;    model_client=model_client,&#10;)&#10;&#10;team = RoundRobinGroupChat(&#10;    participants=[coder, reviewer],&#10;    termination_condition=MaxMessageTermination(max_messages=10) | TextMentionTermination(&quot;APPROVE&quot;),&#10;)&#10;&#10;async def main() -&gt; None:&#10;    result = await team.run(&#10;        task=&quot;实现一个 Web 爬虫，支持深度限制和并发控制，然后互相审查代码质量。&quot;&#10;    )&#10;    print(result.messages[-1].content)&#10;&#10;asyncio.run(main())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autogen_agentchat.agents </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AssistantAgent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autogen_agentchat.teams </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RoundRobinGroupChat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autogen_agentchat.conditions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MaxMessageTermination, TextMentionTermination</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autogen_ext.models.openai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAIChatCompletionClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAIChatCompletionClient(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5.6-terra\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">coder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AssistantAgent(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coder\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    system_message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"你是程序员，负责编写代码实现。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model_client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_client,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reviewer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AssistantAgent(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reviewer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    system_message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"你是审查员。审查通过时在回复末尾写 APPROVE。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model_client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_client,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">team </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RoundRobinGroupChat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    participants</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[coder, reviewer],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    termination_condition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MaxMessageTermination(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_messages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TextMentionTermination(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"APPROVE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> team.run(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"实现一个 Web 爬虫，支持深度限制和并发控制，然后互相审查代码质量。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.messages[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">asyncio.run(main())</span></span></code></pre></div><p>除了按序轮转的 RoundRobinGroupChat，AutoGen 还提供由 LLM 选择下一位发言者的 SelectorGroupChat，以及基于有向图编排的 GraphFlow（工作流式团队），覆盖从自由讨论到结构化流程的谱系。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"crewai-角色扮演\">CrewAI：角色扮演</h2><p>CrewAI 采用更直观的「团队」隐喻——定义角色（Role）、分配任务（Task）、编排流程（Process）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from crewai import Agent, Task, Crew, Process&#10;&#10;researcher = Agent(&#10;    role=&quot;高级研究分析师&quot;,&#10;    goal=&quot;深入研究最新的 AI Agent 技术趋势&quot;,&#10;    backstory=&quot;你是一位拥有 10 年经验的 AI 研究员，擅长分析技术趋势。&quot;,&#10;    verbose=True,&#10;    allow_delegation=True,&#10;    tools=[search_tool]&#10;)&#10;&#10;writer = Agent(&#10;    role=&quot;技术文档撰写专家&quot;,&#10;    goal=&quot;撰写清晰、准确的技术文档&quot;,&#10;    backstory=&quot;你是一位资深技术作家，擅长将复杂概念转化为易懂的文档。&quot;,&#10;    verbose=True,&#10;    tools=[file_tool]&#10;)&#10;&#10;reviewer = Agent(&#10;    role=&quot;质量审查员&quot;,&#10;    goal=&quot;确保文档的技术准确性和内容完整性&quot;,&#10;    backstory=&quot;你是一位严谨的技术审查员，对细节要求极高。&quot;,&#10;    verbose=True&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crewai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Agent, Task, Crew, Process</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">researcher </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4